{"id":"n30203-1-19","stage":0,"title":"강 · 江","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30203-1-19-1","ko":"주말에 뭐 할 생각인가?","zh":"周末有什么打算吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주말에","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생각인가?","meaning":"念头，想法","explanation":"생각：念头，想法；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"念头，想法","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"想做某事的心理或关注；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["생각"]}],"audio":"/audio/10f3c92676a72b4a9592.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n30203-1-19-2","ko":"조용히 강에서 낚시나 좀 할까 해요.","zh":"打算去河边安静地钓钓鱼。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"조용히","meaning":"安静地","explanation":"조용히：安静地","readings":[{"term":"조용히","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75797","senseId":"1","lemma":"조용히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"강에서","meaning":"江，河","explanation":"강：江，河；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"강","audio":"/audio/d90ed2084b71f17cebe5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30203","senseId":"1","lemma":"강","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"낚시나","meaning":"钓鱼","explanation":"낚시：钓鱼；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"낚시","audio":"/audio/997b7b3d44815df9d683.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56098","senseId":"2","lemma":"낚시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할까","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ까：表达犹豫、推测或考虑，连接 보다、하다 等后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해요.","meaning":"考虑、打算做（-ㄹ/을까 하다）","explanation":"하다：考虑、打算做（-ㄹ/을까 하다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"27","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ae038c58a1186312","term":"조용히","zh":"安静地","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3","entryId":"75797","definition":"任何声音都没有地。","pronunciation":["조용히"]},{"id":"d90ed2084b71f17c","term":"강","zh":"江，河","audio":"/audio/d90ed2084b71f17cebe5.mp3","entryId":"30203","definition":"又宽又长、最后流入大海的水流。","pronunciation":["강"]},{"id":"997b7b3d44815df9","term":"낚시","zh":"钓鱼","audio":"/audio/997b7b3d44815df9d683.mp3","entryId":"56098","definition":"用钓具捕鱼。","pronunciation":["낙씨"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干；考虑、打算做（-ㄹ/을까 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/eaced89f8c55d4b0e016.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.76,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=30203","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":28,"sequenceScore":1.2401,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["打算去河边安静地钓钓鱼。","饭都吃完了，现在要做什么呢？","周末有什么打算吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["打算去河边安静地钓钓鱼。","周末有什么打算吗？","饭都吃完了，现在要做什么呢？"],"answer":0}]}
